# Strapi Production Environment Template
# Copy to .env before deploying.
# WARNING: .env is git-ignored — NEVER commit real secrets.
# IMPORTANT: 部署到生产前请重新生成所有密钥: openssl rand -base64 48
#
# Architecture: Strapi runs on the HOST (PM2), PostgreSQL runs in Docker.
# Database is reached at 127.0.0.1:5433 (exposed by docker-compose; host 5432 is system postgres).

